'''Paragon''', which is found in the Journal ("J"), provides a list of global tasks which give additional bonuses upon completion. Each level must be unlocked in order to obtain the rewards. There are two types, one are called Paragon and have to be reclaimed after every [[Change Realms|Realm Change]], the other is called Legacy and stays even after a Realm Change.

